hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1984","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tehband mein jo takhnon se neechey hai wo aag mein hai. (Bukhari: 5787)"
"1985","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pehen-ney key liye sab se mehboob kapda habra tha. (Bukhari: 5813)"
"1986","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab faut huey to Aap ko habra chaadar udhaai gai. (Bukhari: 5814)"
"1987","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke Aap par safed kapda tha jabke Aap soey huey they. Phir main Aap key paas aaya jab Aap jaag chukey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Banda jo (Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi) kahey, phir us par maray, magar Jannat mein daakhil hoga. Main ne kaha: Agarchey wo zina karey aur chori karey? Aap ne farmaya: Agarchey wo zina karey aur chori karey. Main ne kaha: Agarchey wo zina karey aur chori karey? Aap ne farmaya: Agarchey wo zina karey aur chori karey. Main ne kaha: Agarchey wo zina karey aur chori karey? Aap ne farmaya: Agarchey wo zina karey aur chori karey, Abu Zarr ki naak khaak aalood honay par! Jabke Abu Zarr jab iskey sath hadees bayan kartey to kehtey: Agarchey Abu Zarr ki naak khaak aalood ho. (Bukhari: 5827)"
"1988","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne resham se mana kya magar aisa. Aur Aap ne apni donon ungliyon se ishaara kya jo angoothey se milti hain. Yaani nishaan. (Bukhari: 5828)"
"1989","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Umar Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein resham pehney wo aakhirat mein use na pehnega. (Bukhari: 5834)"
"1990","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein mana kya ke ham sonay chaandi key bartanon mein piyen aur un mein khaaen. Aur resham aur deebaaj pehen-ney se aur us par baithney se. (Bukhari: 5837)"
"1991","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke aadmi zaafraan lagaaye. (Bukhari: 5846)"
"1992","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne jooton mein namaz padhtey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. (Bukhari: 5850)"
"1993","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi joota pehney to daaen se shuru karey. Aur jab utaaray to baaen se shuru karey. Taake daahina un donon mein pehla pehna jaaey aur aakhri utaara jaaey. (Bukhari: 5856)"
"1994","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaandi ki angoothi banaai aur us mein Muhammad Rasulullah naqsh kya. Aur farmaya: Beshak main ne chaandi ki angoothi banaai hai aur us mein Muhammad Rasulullah naqsh kya hai. To koi merey naqsh par naqsh na karaaey. (Bukhari: 5877)"
"1995","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mardon mein mukhannason aur auraton mein mard ban-ney waliyon par laanat ki. Aur farmaya: Unhey apne gharon se nikaalo! Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne fulaan ko nikaala. Aur Umar ne fulaan ko nikaala. (Bukhari: 5886)"
"1996","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mushrikeen ki mukhaalifat karo! Daadhiyaan badhaao aur moonchhein kaato! (Bukhari: 5892)"
"1997","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood aur Nasaara khizaab nahi lagaatey. To unki mukhaalifat karo! (Bukhari: 5899)"
"1998","[AI-translation] Maalik key betey Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baal ghungryaaley they, na seedhey aur na ghungryaaley sakht. Donoon kaanon aur kandhey key darmiyaan. (Bukhari: 5905)"
"1999","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badey haathon aur qadmon waley aur haseen chehrey waley they. Main ne Aap key baad aur na Aap se pehley Aap jaisa dekha. Jabke Aap khuli hatheliyon waley they. (Bukhari: 5907)"
"2000","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaza se mana kya. (Bukhari: 5921)"
"2001","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko umda khushbu lagaten jo Aap paatey yahan tak ke main Aap key sar aur Aapki daadhi mein khushbu ki chamak paaten. (Bukhari: 5923)"
"2002","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khushbu wapas nahi kartey they. (Bukhari: 5929)"
"2003","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne haathon se zarira key sath khushbu lagai Widaa key Hajj mein. Halal aur ehraam key liye. (Bukhari: 5930). Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan se, jis saal unhon-ne Hajj kya, jabke wo mimbar par they, jabke wo kehtey they. Jabke unhon-ne baalon ki choti pakdi jo pehredaar key haath mein thi: Tumhaarey ulema kahaan hain? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is jaisi se mana kartey huey suna hai. Aur Aap farmaatey hain: Beshak Bani Israel halaak huey jab unki auraton ne ye apnaaein. (5932). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne jodney wali aur judwaanay wali aur godnay wali aur gudwaanay wali par laanat ki. (5933). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nazar haq hai. Aur godnay se mana kya. (5944). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2004","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jo ye tasweerein banaatey hain unhey Qiyaamat key din azaab diya jaaeyga. Un se kaha jaaeyga: Zinda karo jo tum ne paida kya! (Bukhari: 5951)"
"2005","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Aur us se zyada zaalim kaun hai jo jaata hai ke meri makhlooq jaisa paida karey. To wo daana paida karein aur zarra paida karein. Aur aik riwayat mein badhaa diya: Aur jau paida karein! (Bukhari: 5953)"
"2006","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo tasweer banaaey to beshak Allah use azaab dega yahan tak ke wo us mein rooh phoonkey. Jabke wo phoonkney wala nahi hai. (Bukhari: 5963). Adab ki kitaab."
